            "review_title": "Review at Cuu Van Long seafood buffet",
            "review_text": "HannahH\nBoston, Massachusetts4 contributions\n0\nGreat seafood buffet\nJan 2020\nFresh seafood! I had 2 big crabs and shrimps and octopus and oyster. All very fresh. Price is good for all you can eat seafood. We had a great dinner there. The only down side is that the restaurant is too crowded, which is reasonable because of cheap price compare to so much seafood.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 2, 2020",
